  "statements": {
    "hookes-law": "The restoring force of a deformed system is directly proportional to its displacement from equilibrium and points opposite to it, $\\kF = -\\kk\\kx$. This is Hooke’s law, and the simplest oscillations occur in systems that obey it. From the force and the displacement you can find the force constant."
  },
